  "text": "G\n·\nGenesys AQM\nQUALITY INTELLIGENCE\n◌\nOverview\n◷\nEvaluations\n▥\nAnalytics\n◎\nCalibration\n◇\nPolicies\n▤\nEvaluation Forms\n▦\nQuestion Groups\n⚙\nSettings\n☷\nConversations\n◈\nConversation review\nWorkspace / Forms\nADMIN\nJev managed securely by automation service\nCONFIGURATION\nEvaluation Forms\n\nPolicies pin published versions. Drafts can be tested without entering production analytics.\n\nTable\nCards\nImport form\n＋ New form\nStatus\nAll statuses\nDraft\nTesting\nPublished\nRetired\nVersion\nAll versions\nLatest version per family\nUsage\nAll usage\nAssigned to policy\nUnassigned\nSearch\n6 results\nForm name ↓\n\t\nStatus\n\t\nVersion\n\t\nQuestions\n\t\nAssigned policies\n\t\nServer evaluations\n\t\nServer avg score\n\t\nLast modified\n\nSales / Service Quality\tPUBLISHED\tv1\t5\t1\t0\t—\t—\nRetention / Cancellation\tPUBLISHED\tv1\t5\t1\t0\t—\t—\nGeneral Customer Service\tPUBLISHED\tv17\t3\t5\t8\t66%\t—\nCustomer Service - AI Scoring\tPUBLISHED\tv1\t9\t0\t0\t—\t—\nCompliance & Identity Verification\tPUBLISHED\tv1\t5\t2\t0\t—\t—\nComplaints Handling\tPUBLISHED\tv1\t5\t1\t0\t—\t—\nPUBLISHED · VERSION 17\nGeneral Customer Service\nExport JSON\nDuplicate as new form\nTEST FORM\nEdit as new version\nRetire\n\nThis version's question and scoring definition is locked. Historical evaluations retain its snapshot.\n\nForm name\nDescription\nPass score\n70%\nCritical questions\nWarm opening\nUnderstanding the issue\nResolution\nQuestion groups\n\nQuestion weights determine the overall score. Read-only published definition.\n\nAdd group\nAdd reusable group\nOverall scoring\nQuestion weighted\nGroup weighted\n\nQuestion weighted combines applicable question credits. Group weighted combines group scores using their relative weights; configure a weight for every scoring group.\n\nYes threshold65%\nCustomer care\n↑\n↓\nDuplicate group\nDelete group\nGroup name\nGroup description\nGroup scoring\nUse group scoring settings\n01\nWarm opening\nYes / No\n\nDid the agent greet the customer and offer help at the start of the conversation?\n\nWeight 1 · Enabled · ID greeting\n\n↑\n↓\nRead only\n02\nUnderstanding the issue\nOrdered score\n\nHow effectively did the agent establish and acknowledge the customer’s actual issue?\n\nWeight 1.2 · Enabled · ID understanding\n\nPoor (poor · credit 0)\nAbsent or counterproductive behaviour.\nNeeds improvement (needs_improvement · credit 0.33)\nSome appropriate behaviour, with clear gaps.\nGood (good · credit 0.67)\nAppropriate and effective behaviour with minor gaps.\nExcellent (excellent · credit 1)\nConsistently clear, effective and considerate behaviour.\n↑\n↓\nRead only\n03\nResolution\nMultiple choice\n\nWhat is the best description of the issue outcome by the end of the conversation?\n\nWeight 1.5 · Enabled · ID resolution\n\nFully resolved (fully_resolved · credit 1)\nThe customer’s issue was resolved in the conversation.\nPartially resolved (partially_resolved · credit 0.5)\nMeaningful progress, but further action remains.\nUnresolved (unresolved · credit 0)\nThe issue remained unresolved with no meaningful progress.\nNot applicable (not_applicable · credit unscored)\nThe conversation does not present a resolvable issue.\n↑\n↓\nRead only\nAdd question\nView history\nISOLATED SANDBOX\nTest form\n\nTry this exact form draft on a small sample. Test results are isolated from production quality, coverage, and monitoring.\n\nExecution\nLegacy browser sandbox (development)\nDurable server sandbox (recommended)\nSource\nSynthetic\nGenesys Cloud\nSelection\nMost recent\nDeterministic random\nManual selection\nConversations\n\n5 conversations · 3 questions · 1 form · 5 evaluation assignments · up to 5 Jev requests\n\nThe server uses its configured Jev credential and keeps isolated durable test history. Jev receives applicable questions in batches, one request per dependency wave. Skipped questions incur no request. Maximum sample size: 20.\n\nTest formRefresh test history",
